<title>UK: CRICKET-CORK TO MISS ONE-DAY SERIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-CORK TO MISS ONE-DAY SERIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dominic Cork will miss  England's one-day international series against Australia later this month because of injury.</p>
<p>The Derbyshire all-rounder has not played since injuring his groin in his county's opening Championship match against Kent last month.</p>
<p>The first one-day international between the two sides is at Headingley next Thursday.</p>
